OL,3,AData centre debate heats up ahead of US
OL,4,Amidterms - here's what you need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FData centre debate heats up ahead of US
OL,7,Fmidterms - here's what you need to know
OL,9,FUntil a few years ago many of us may
OL,10,Fhave been blissfully unaware of what a
OL,11,Fdata centre was.
OL,13,FThese giant, warehouse-like buildings
OL,14,Fpower virtually all our internet
OL,15,Factivity, from our web searches and
OL,16,Femails to movie downloads and online
OL,17,Fbanking.
OL,19,FThey are at the heart of the AI boom,
OL,20,Fhousing the advanced computer chips and
OL,21,Fservers needed to run services like
OL,22,FChatGPT and Claude.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
